# Presumed Dead ({1}{B}): until end of turn the target creature gets +2/+0 and gains "When this creature dies, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control and suspect it" (CR 611.2a, 701.60a). Bot1's Grizzly Bears is 4/2 and attacks (so it is tapped, and Bot2 takes exactly 4); when Lightning Bolt kills it afterwards it comes back untapped (not tapped, as Fake Your Own Death returns it) as a new 2/2 object, suspected: menace and unable to block, and without the granted ability.

